sequenceDiagram
  participant U as Human/Agent
  participant A as Application
  participant K as Kernel/Policy
  participant C as Capability
  participant L as Ledger
  participant G as Graph Projection
  participant B as Behavior
  U->>A: Command / proposal
  A->>K: validate + authorize
  K->>C: execute governed effect
  C-->>K: result + postcondition evidence
  K->>L: append event(s) + receipt
  L-->>G: project
  G-->>B: matching event/pattern
  B->>A: new observation/proposal
  Note over B,C: Behavior never calls governed capability directly
